      "writtenOn": "2014-10-21T22:00:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nope, it doesn\u0027t exist at this point. prepareToWriteFile will delete it if it exists. Added a test to cover this anyway.\n\nI\u0027m intentionally not using mkdirs as all the create actions for the tree are added preorder, so all parent directories will either have a create action before this one or a validate action and it should have failed before getting here if they did not exist.",
